# Kite binary frame: one 44-byte quote packet for USDINR25NOV26FUT (token 268040195, CDS).
# Kite sends currency prices in units of 10^-7 rupees (zerodha-api-docs 10-websocket.md).
0001                    # packets in this frame
002c                    # packet length 44
0ff9f803                # instrument token 268040195 (low byte 3: CDS)
34869050                # last price, in 10^-7 rupees (CDS) 881234000
00000001                # last traded quantity 1
348484e0                # average traded price 881100000
00025314                # volume 152340
00000834                # total buy quantity 2100
0000076c                # total sell quantity 1900
347b5d20                # open 880500000
34924080                # high 882000000
3473bc00                # low 880000000
347ff100                # close (previous day) 880800000
